    "identifier": "lyonesse-wyrd-sorcery-step-between-moments",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Wyrd Sorcery · уровень 14</b></p><p>When you use Wyrd Time, you gain the following benefits while it is in effect:<br>• When you cast a spell that effects other creatures, if the spell requires a saving throw, all targets have Disadvantage on that saving throw. Wyrd Time still ends immediately.<br>• When you fail a Saving Throw you can spend 4 Sorcery<br>Points to succeed instead.<br>• At the start of your turn, you can spend 1 Sorcery<br>Point to gain True Sight out to 30 feet until the end of your turn.<br>• You may spend 2 Sorcery Points when you cast Modify<br>Memory. When you do this the creature has Disadvantage on its saving throw and casting the spell doesn’t end Wyrd Time.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Условные эффекты и конец хода — вручную.</li></ul>"
    },
